      "rota": "en/under-discussion",
      "frase": "Portugal had 431,35 practising physicians per hundred thousand inhabitants in 2024, between Belgium, with the lowest value among the twenty-seven member states with data (334,25), and Greece, with the highest (626,89).",
      "html": "In the European comparison, Portugal spent <span class=\"claim claim-com-chip\"><span data-claim=\"eurostat-hlth-sha11-hf-a-pc_gdp-tot_hf-pt-2024\" class=\"claim-value\">10,20</span><span class=\"claim-sufixo\"> %</span><a class=\"src-chip\" href=\"/en/ledger/eurostat-hlth-sha11-hf-a-pc_gdp-tot_hf-pt-2024\" data-nonledger=\"proveniencia\" data-selo-etiqueta=\"Eurostat\" title=\"Eurostat\"><span class=\"src-chip-texto\">source</span><span class=\"vh\"> · <span>Eurostat</span></span></a></span> of GDP on health in <a class=\"discussao-periodo\" data-discussao-periodo=\"eurostat-hlth-sha11-hf-a-pc_gdp-tot_hf-pt-2024\" href=\"/en/ledger/eurostat-hlth-sha11-hf-a-pc_gdp-tot_hf-pt-2024\"><span class=\"data-da-linha\" data-nonledger=\"data-da-linha\" data-de-linha=\"eurostat-hlth-sha11-hf-a-pc_gdp-tot_hf-pt-2024\" data-de-campo=\"reference_date\">2024</span></a>, the EU <span class=\"claim claim-com-chip\"><span data-claim=\"eurostat-hlth-sha11-hf-a-pc_gdp-tot_hf-eu27_2020-2024\" class=\"claim-value\">10,16</span><span class=\"claim-sufixo\"> %</span><a class=\"src-chip\" href=\"/en/ledger/eurostat-hlth-sha11-hf-a-pc_gdp-tot_hf-eu27_2020-2024\" data-nonledger=\"proveniencia\" data-selo-etiqueta=\"Eurostat\" title=\"Eurostat\"><span class=\"src-chip-texto\">source</span><span class=\"vh\"> · <span>Eurostat</span></span></a></span>; per inhabitant, in current euros and without correction for price levels, <span class=\"claim claim-com-chip\"><span data-claim=\"eurostat-hlth-sha11-hf-a-eur_hab-tot_hf-pt-2024\" class=\"claim-value\">2 764,83</span><span class=\"claim-sufixo\"> euros</span><a class=\"src-chip\" href=\"/en/ledger/eurostat-hlth-sha11-hf-a-eur_hab-tot_hf-pt-2024\" data-nonledger=\"proveniencia\" data-selo-etiqueta=\"Eurostat\" title=\"Eurostat\"><span class=\"src-chip-texto\">source</span><span class=\"vh\"> · <span>Eurostat</span></span></a></span> against <span class=\"claim claim-com-chip\"><span data-claim=\"eurostat-hlth-sha11-hf-a-eur_hab-tot_hf-eu27_2020-2024\" class=\"claim-value\">4 074,88</span><a class=\"src-chip\" href=\"/en/ledger/eurostat-hlth-sha11-hf-a-eur_hab-tot_hf-eu27_2020-2024\" data-nonledger=\"proveniencia\" data-selo-etiqueta=\"Eurostat\" title=\"Eurostat\"><span class=\"src-chip-texto\">source</span><span class=\"vh\"> · <span>Eurostat</span></span></a></span> in the EU; in government schemes and compulsory contributory schemes alone, <span class=\"claim claim-com-chip\"><span data-claim=\"eurostat-hlth-sha11-hf-a-pc_gdp-hf1-pt-2024\" class=\"claim-value\">6,31</span><span class=\"claim-sufixo\"> %</span><a class=\"src-chip\" href=\"/en/ledger/eurostat-hlth-sha11-hf-a-pc_gdp-hf1-pt-2024\" data-nonledger=\"proveniencia\" data-selo-etiqueta=\"Eurostat\" title=\"Eurostat\"><span class=\"src-chip-texto\">source</span><span class=\"vh\"> · <span>Eurostat</span></span></a></span> of GDP against <span class=\"claim claim-com-chip\"><span data-claim=\"eurostat-hlth-sha11-hf-a-pc_gdp-hf1-eu27_2020-2024\" class=\"claim-value\">8,17</span><span class=\"claim-sufixo\"> %</span><a class=\"src-chip\" href=\"/en/ledger/eurostat-hlth-sha11-hf-a-pc_gdp-hf1-eu27_2020-2024\" data-nonledger=\"proveniencia\" data-selo-etiqueta=\"Eurostat\" title=\"Eurostat\"><span class=\"src-chip-texto\">source</span><span class=\"vh\"> · <span>Eurostat</span></span></a></span>. Portugal had <span class=\"claim claim-com-chip\"><span data-claim=\"eurostat-pt-phys\" class=\"claim-value\">431,35</span><a class=\"src-chip\" href=\"/en/ledger/eurostat-pt-phys\" data-nonledger=\"proveniencia\" data-selo-etiqueta=\"Eurostat\" title=\"Eurostat\"><span class=\"src-chip-texto\">source</span><span class=\"vh\"> · <span>Eurostat</span></span></a></span> practising physicians per hundred thousand inhabitants in <a class=\"discussao-periodo\" data-discussao-periodo=\"eurostat-pt-phys\" href=\"/en/ledger/eurostat-pt-phys\"><span class=\"data-da-linha\" data-nonledger=\"data-da-linha\" data-de-linha=\"eurostat-pt-phys\" data-de-campo=\"reference_date\">2024</span></a>, between Belgium, with the lowest value among the twenty-seven member states with data (<span class=\"claim claim-com-chip\"><span data-claim=\"eurostat-be-phys\" class=\"claim-value\">334,25</span><a class=\"src-chip\" href=\"/en/ledger/eurostat-be-phys\" data-nonledger=\"proveniencia\" data-selo-etiqueta=\"Eurostat\" title=\"Eurostat\"><span class=\"src-chip-texto\">source</span><span class=\"vh\"> · <span>Eurostat</span></span></a></span>), and Greece, with the highest (<span class=\"claim claim-com-chip\"><span data-claim=\"eurostat-el-phys\" class=\"claim-value\">626,89</span><a class=\"src-chip\" href=\"/en/ledger/eurostat-el-phys\" data-nonledger=\"proveniencia\" data-selo-etiqueta=\"Eurostat\" title=\"Eurostat\"><span class=\"src-chip-texto\">source</span><span class=\"vh\"> · <span>Eurostat</span></span></a></span>).",
